   $q$Which sentence would fit best in the third paragraph?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Some even lend tablets loaded with e-books that visitors can take home.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The nearest library may be very far from some homes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"belongs-in-other-paragraph"},{"text":"The first stop of the day is often an elementary school.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"belongs-elsewhere"},{"text":"Driving a large bus requires a special kind of license.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-focus-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Some even lend tablets loaded with e-books that visitors can take home.$q$, $q$Paragraph 3 lists what bookmobiles offer besides books, and lending tablets is one more offering. The sentence about distance belongs in paragraph 2, which explains the problem bookmobiles solve.$q$, 'draft', '73c02adc-a95f-5628-9262-fdf377c1ba7e')
